// example really does return 17; the three rule violations produce exactly the
// errors quoted here.
// Corrections in this pass:
//  - the effect-row-variable example had one argument too few in its signature
//    (`foo f x` against `foo :: (Int -> <Rand,e> Int) -> <Rand,e> Int`).
//  - replaced the non-ASCII subset glyph.
